message: "If you use this software, please cite the article listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "From single-pixel imaging to scattered light imaging: a practical tutorial (notebook)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-01"          # TODO: date of the GitHub release
license: CC0-1.0
